<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings flat, 500kt sails to U.S.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings flat, 500kt sails to U.S.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 797,323 tonnes in the week to November 19, little changed from the previous week's 773,446 tonnes, the Shetland Islands Council Marine Operations Department said.</p>
<p>Two-thirds of the crude sailed for the U.S., with most of the rest going to British refineries.</p>
